# This repo is developed on Windows (core.autocrlf=true) and runs in Linux
# containers. Anything the containers execute must keep LF endings: a shell
# script checked out with CRLF fails at the shebang with a confusing
# "bad interpreter: /bin/bash^M", and docker/postgres-init/10-app-role.sh is
# bind-mounted straight from the working tree, so a fresh clone on Windows
# would have broken it without this.
*.sh text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
*.dockerignore text eol=lf
docker-compose*.yml text eol=lf
